      "text": "Neurotech, for good. Surrey Neurotech Society is the University of Surrey's first student group dedicated to neurotechnology and the fourth in the UK. We connect students across neuroscience, AI and technology to explore how they can work together to enhance human potential. JOIN THE SOCIETY → EXPLORE FOCUS AREAS → Open to all students. All backgrounds. All levels. Now WHAT'S HAPPENING Events will appear once confirmed. SEE EVENTS → 01 LEARN Friendly talks, workshops, and explainers. → 02 MEET Connect with curious students from every course. → 03 BUILD RESPONSIBLY Ethics, inclusion, and wellbe",
