      "text": "MANY DOORS INTO NEUROTECH Different paths. Shared curiosity. Psychology Understanding minds and behaviour. Computing Algorithms, data and intelligent systems. Bioscience Cells, systems and the biology of the brain. Design Human-centred design and creative solutions. Ethics Questions of fairness, privacy, consent and impact. Curious beginners You don't need experience — just curiosity.",
