      "text": "WHAT WE DO TOGETHER Explore. Discuss. Create. Together. We bring big ideas to life through events, projects and community. There's something for everyone, whether you're here to learn, build or just get curious. SEE ALL EVENTS → 01 Talks & Events Expert speakers from academia, startups and industry share insights into emerging developments in neurotech, AI and cognitive science. → 02 Workshops Practical experiences including workshops, journal clubs and projects such as building brain-computer interfaces. → 03 Inter-University Collaborations Large-scale events including hackathons, symposiums ",
